    "updated_at": "2020-12-08T13:42:32Z",
    "body": "I can't tell exactly what you mean without a screenshot, but is it possible you're looking for the `line_break` module?\r\n\r\n`add_newline` puts a blank line *between* prompts (i.e. anytime the prompt is drawn, it prints a blank line before drawing the prompt), while `line_break` causes an individual prompt to be broken into two lines.\r\n\r\n`line_break` is a module, not a global option, so you would change this with\r\n\r\n```\r\n[line_break]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n```",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
